{"id":"pokryt_","lemma":"покрыть","pos":"verb","rank":4661,"glosses":["to cover, to roof (a house) ; to thatch, to tile","to coat (with paint)","to cover, to trump (in card games)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/19/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D1%80%D1%8B%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D1%80%D1%8B%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"покрою","2s":"покроешь","3s":"покроет","1p":"покроем","2p":"покроете","3p":"покроют"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"покрой","2p":"покройте"}}},"past":{"m":"покрыл","p":"покрыли","f":"покрыла","n":"покрыло"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"крыть","examples":[{"text":"Думаю, страховка это покроет.","en":"I think insurance will cover it.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"insurance"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Снег полностью покрыл город.","en":"Snow completely covered the town.","words":[{"g":"snow"},{"g":"completely"},null,{"g":"city, town"}]},{"text":"Мы надеемся покрыть дефицит.","en":"We hope to cover the deficit.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to hope","l":"надеяться"},null,{"g":"deficit"}]},{"text":"Мы должны покрыть его лаком.","en":"We must give it a coat of varnish.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,null,{"g":"him / his"},null]},{"text":"Я не могу покрыть ваши потери на этот раз.","en":"I can't cover your losses this time.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},{"g":"loss","l":"потеря"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"time"}]}]}